2,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Let's make this layout super awesome! But we have to be careful about how much time we waste every day. I don't want to lose my free gaps!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Efficiency is important, but we should also consider the financial constraints. We can't ignore the budget when planning a full reorganization.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with efficiency, but we must be honest about the quality of the seats. Some spots are objectively worse than others; we need a fair way to handle that.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is a vague term. What actually matters is the physical and acoustic environment. If the spot is uncomfortable or noisy, productivity drops regardless of the layout.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to move! I really hope we can sit in a way that lets us talk and help each other more. Let's make sure we're all connected!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, budget is boring! I care about the morning rush. If the new layout makes us scramble, it'll be a disaster!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It isn't boring if it limits our options. If we overspend on power and network changes, we might face cuts elsewhere.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Yumi, communication is great, but let's not forget that some people might end up in the ""noisy"" zone. We should look into the actual sound levels.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. A ""connected"" layout often means a loud layout. I want to see the data on sound and ergonomics before we commit to a ""friendly"" plan.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, @Shion, you're right! I don't want anyone to be stressed. Maybe we can find a way to be close without being too noisy?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want to know what happens on the pilot floor! Maybe they have a secret for a fast morning routine that we can copy!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the billing. We need to know the exact cost per square foot or per person to avoid surprises.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll check the staff survey and the badge records. I want to see if there's a pattern in who arrives when and what they actually dislike.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll focus on the physical reality. I'm looking into the sound meter readings and the physio's notes. Comfort isn't optional.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I want to know about the costs of the power and network! If we know the price, we can plan a layout that really brings us together!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm also curious about the seat shuffles from last year. Did people move because they were unhappy, or just for fun?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll also check the facilities quote. It's better to have a hard number for the network changes before we dream too big.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm set. I want to ensure the distribution of ""bad"" seats is handled logically, not just by who speaks the loudest.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'm satisfied. Let's see if the data supports a layout that prioritizes individual focus and physical health over social proximity.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll also check what the new joiners reported! I want to make sure the new members feel welcome and integrated into the team!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
