60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A is a nightmare! Imagine spending nine minutes every single morning just to find a spot and plug in! I hate it!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A and B are financially reckless. The cost of power and network changes for B, and the inefficiency of A, make C the only logical choice.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Option A is the worst for equity; the early birds get the windows every single day. Option B is fair, but as Shion said, it's physically taxing.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A and B are absurd. Forcing a person to reset their ergonomic setup daily or monthly is a recipe for chronic pain. Option C is the only professional choice.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a bit sad about Option C because we won't mix as much, but Option A sounds so stressful for everyone! I want us to be happy!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, we can still talk and be friends in Option C! We just don't have to waste our precious gaps on ""setup time""!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Yumi, think of the budget. Option C is a one-time cost. Option B is a recurring expense that we simply cannot justify given our current billing.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if we go with Option C, we must agree on a fair way to assign the window seats. We can't just let the senior staff take them.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"I don't care who gets the window, as long as the quietest spots are assigned to those who need focus and the seats stay put.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"If we go with Option C, can we arrange the ""functions"" so that the new joiners are sitting right in the middle of the experts?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"Yes! Put the experts and the learners together in one block! That way it's fast, stable, and we still get to learn!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"That is a reasonable compromise. As long as the layout is fixed and the power is run once, I am fully in favor of Option C.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I can accept Option C, but only if we explicitly document the seat quality and agree on the assignment process now, rather than letting it happen by habit.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,I agree. Let's prioritize the acoustic and ergonomic data when assigning those fixed seats. It's the only way to ensure long-term productivity.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"I love that idea! We can be stable and cost-effective, but still be a supportive team where everyone can learn from each other!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! No more two-week shuffles and no more nine-minute morning scrambles! I'm voting for the one that saves my time!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,It is the only option that respects the budget and prevents recurring waste. My vote is decided.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"As long as we are transparent about the ""bad"" seats and assign them fairly, Option C is the most sustainable and honest choice.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shion,,Logic and physical health both point to the same conclusion. Stability is the only way to maintain a proper workstation.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm happy we found a way to keep the team spirit alive while being smart about the costs! Let's do this!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
